## Insurance Operations

### Use Case: Claims Processing

**Scenario:** Insurance claim submission and processing

```
Claims Workflow:
1. Customer submits claim
2. Validate claim details
3. Check policy active
4. Assess damage/loss
5. Calculate payout
6. Generate check/transfer
7. Update policy records
8. Send confirmation
```

### Theory: Long-Running Transactions

```
Challenge: Claims processing takes hours/days

Solution: Pseudo-Conversational Design

Step 1: RECEIVE claim → Validate → RETURN 'STEP2'
         ↓
Step 2: RECEIVE assessment → Calculate → RETURN 'STEP3'
         ↓
Step 3: RECEIVE approval → Process payment → RETURN 'COMPLETE'

Benefits:
├─ Minimal memory per step
├─ User can take breaks
├─ Fault tolerance
└─ Audit trail per step
```

### Code Example: Claims Processing

```cobol
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLAIMS-PROCESS.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-CLAIM-ID          PIC 9(8).
01 WS-POLICY-ID         PIC 9(8).
01 WS-CLAIM-AMOUNT      PIC 9(9)V99.
01 WS-STEP              PIC X(20).

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 COMMAREA.
   05 CA-CLAIM-ID       PIC 9(8).
   05 CA-POLICY-ID      PIC 9(8).
   05 CA-STEP           PIC X(20).
   05 CA-STATUS         PIC X(20).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING COMMAREA.

MAIN-PROCESS.
    MOVE CA-STEP TO WS-STEP.
    
    EVALUATE WS-STEP
        WHEN 'INITIAL'
            PERFORM PROCESS-INITIAL
        WHEN 'ASSESS'
            PERFORM PROCESS-ASSESSMENT
        WHEN 'APPROVE'
            PERFORM PROCESS-APPROVAL
        WHEN 'PAY'
            PERFORM PROCESS-PAYMENT
        WHEN OTHER
            PERFORM UNKNOWN-STEP
    END-EVALUATE.

PROCESS-INITIAL.
    * Receive claim details
    EXEC CICS RECEIVE MAP('CLAIMMAP')
        MAPSET('CLAIMSET')
        INTO(CLAIM-REQUEST)
    END-EXEC.
    
    * Validate policy
    EXEC CICS READ
        DATASET('POLICIES')
        INTO(POLICY-RECORD)
        RIDFLD(CA-POLICY-ID)
        NOT-FOUND
            PERFORM POLICY-NOT-FOUND
        END-NOT-FOUND
    END-EXEC.
    
    * Check policy active
    IF POLICY-STATUS NOT = 'ACTIVE'
        MOVE 'Policy not active' TO CA-STATUS
        PERFORM RETURN-TO-CALLER
    END-IF.
    
    * Save claim temporarily
    EXEC CICS WRITE
        DATASET('CLAIMS')
        FROM(CLAIM-RECORD)
        RIDFLD(CA-CLAIM-ID)
    END-EXEC.
    
    * Update step for next invocation
    MOVE 'ASSESS' TO CA-STEP.
    MOVE 'Claim received, awaiting assessment' TO CA-STATUS.
    
    * Send acknowledgment
    EXEC CICS SEND MAP('ACKMAP')
        MAPSET('CLAIMSET')
        FROM(ACKNOWLEDGMENT-AREA)
        ERASE
    END-EXEC.
    
    * Return with TRANSID for next step
    PERFORM RETURN-TO-CALLER.

PROCESS-ASSESSMENT.
    * Read existing claim
    EXEC CICS READ
        DATASET('CLAIMS')
        INTO(CLAIM-RECORD)
        RIDFLD(CA-CLAIM-ID)
    END-EXEC.
    
    * Receive assessment from adjuster
    EXEC CICS RECEIVE MAP('ASSESSMAP')
        MAPSET('ASSESSSET')
        INTO(ASSESSMENT-DATA)
    END-EXEC.
    
    * Update claim with assessment
    MOVE ASSESSED-AMOUNT TO CLAIM-AMOUNT.
    MOVE 'ASSESSED' TO CLAIM-STATUS.
    
    EXEC CICS UPDATE
        DATASET('CLAIMS')
        FROM(CLAIM-RECORD)
        RIDFLD(CA-CLAIM-ID)
    END-EXEC.
    
    EXEC CICS SYNCPOINT
    END-EXEC.
    
    * Move to approval step
    MOVE 'APPROVE' TO CA-STEP.
    MOVE 'Assessed, awaiting approval' TO CA-STATUS.
    PERFORM RETURN-TO-CALLER.

PROCESS-APPROVAL.
    * Read claim for approval
    EXEC CICS READ
        DATASET('CLAIMS')
        INTO(CLAIM-RECORD)
        RIDFLD(CA-CLAIM-ID)
    END-EXEC.
    
    * Receive approval decision
    EXEC CICS RECEIVE MAP('APPROVEMAP')
        MAPSET('APPROVESET')
        INTO(APPROVAL-DATA)
    END-EXEC.
    
    IF APPROVAL-DECISION NOT = 'YES'
        MOVE 'REJECTED' TO CLAIM-STATUS
        PERFORM UPDATE-AND-RETURN
    END-IF.
    
    * Move to payment
    MOVE 'PAY' TO CA-STEP.
    MOVE 'Approved, processing payment' TO CA-STATUS.
    PERFORM UPDATE-AND-RETURN.

PROCESS-PAYMENT.
    * Read claim
    EXEC CICS READ
        DATASET('CLAIMS')
        INTO(CLAIM-RECORD)
        RIDFLD(CA-CLAIM-ID)
    END-EXEC.
    
    * Call payment service
    EXEC CICS LINK
        PROGRAM('PAYMENT-PROCESS')
        COMMAREA(PAYMENT-AREA)
        LENGTH(PAYMENT-LENGTH)
    END-EXEC.
    
    IF PAYMENT-STATUS NOT = 'SUCCESS'
        MOVE 'Payment failed' TO CA-STATUS
        PERFORM RETURN-TO-CALLER
    END-IF.
    
    * Mark as paid
    MOVE 'PAID' TO CLAIM-STATUS.
    MOVE PAYMENT-DATE TO CLAIM-PAID-DATE.
    
    EXEC CICS UPDATE
        DATASET('CLAIMS')
        FROM(CLAIM-RECORD)
        RIDFLD(CA-CLAIM-ID)
    END-EXEC.
    
    EXEC CICS SYNCPOINT
    END-EXEC.
    
    * Send final confirmation
    MOVE 'COMPLETED' TO CA-STEP.
    MOVE 'Claim processed and paid' TO CA-STATUS.
    PERFORM RETURN-TO-CALLER.

RETURN-TO-CALLER.
    EXEC CICS RETURN
        TRANSID('CLAIM')
        COMMAREA(COMMAREA)
        LENGTH(LENGTH OF COMMAREA)
    END-EXEC.

POLICY-NOT-FOUND.
    MOVE 'Policy not found' TO CA-STATUS.
    PERFORM RETURN-TO-CALLER.

UNKNOWN-STEP.
    MOVE 'Unknown step' TO CA-STATUS.
    PERFORM RETURN-TO-CALLER.

UPDATE-AND-RETURN.
    EXEC CICS UPDATE
        DATASET('CLAIMS')
        FROM(CLAIM-RECORD)
        RIDFLD(CA-CLAIM-ID)
    END-EXEC.
    
    EXEC CICS SYNCPOINT
    END-EXEC.
    
    PERFORM RETURN-TO-CALLER.
```

