## Troubleshooting & Debugging

### Common Issues and Solutions

#### Issue 1: Transaction Timeout

```
Symptom: "Transaction abended at 00:00:05"

Causes:
├─ Waiting for locked resource
├─ Slow database query
├─ Network delay
└─ Program infinite loop

Solutions:
├─ Reduce lock hold time
├─ Optimize SQL queries
├─ Use connection pooling
├─ Add timeout handling in code
```

#### Issue 2: Deadlock

```
Scenario:
┌─────────────┐              ┌─────────────┐
│ Transaction │              │ Transaction │
│      A      │              │      B      │
└──────┬──────┘              └──────┬──────┘
       │                             │
       ├─ Lock Record 1 ───────────┤
       │                             ├─ Lock Record 2
       │                             │
       ├─ Wait Record 2 ◄──────────┤
       │ (BLOCKED)         Wait Record 1
       │                   (BLOCKED)
       
DEADLOCK!

CICS Solution:
├─ Detect deadlock condition
├─ Abort one transaction
├─ Roll back changes
├─ Return error to application
└─ Application retries with backoff
```

#### Issue 3: Out of Storage

```
Error: "ASRA - Storage violation"

Causes:
├─ Array index out of bounds
├─ Uninitialized variable use
├─ String overflow
├─ Memory leak in loop

Debug Steps:
├─ Enable CEDF (debugger)
├─ Set breakpoint at error location
├─ Inspect variable contents
├─ Check allocation sizes
└─ Add bounds checking
```

### Using CEDF (CICS Debugger)

```cobol
