END-IF.

* Inspect variables:
EXEC CICS DEBUG-DISPLAY
    FROM(CUSTOMER-RECORD)
    LENGTH(100)
END-EXEC.

* Disable debugging:
EXEC CICS DEBUG-OFF
END-EXEC.
```

